cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, methodology, or published search records, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "SETIsearch: Panchromatic (>3-Octave, 0.305-2.515 um) Echelle Laser, Frequency-Comb, Radio & Photometric Technosignature Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Prospectively locked, reproducible archival searches and pure-stdlib numerical audits
  for panchromatic near-UV, optical, near-infrared YJH, thermal K-band, and simultaneous
  YJHK laser and periodic frequency-comb technosignatures (0.305-2.515 um across VLT UVES_NUV,
  ESO HARPS, VLT ESPRESSO, ESO NIRPS, VLT CRIRES+, TNG HARPS-N, Calar Alto CARMENES_VIS,
  CFHT 3.6 m SPIRou APERO 0.7.295, and FEROS; 175 unique stars and 1,190 high-resolution
  echelle exposures totaling 252.25 h in V3.0-V3.7 + COMB_V4_1 with Keplerian planetary
  de-Doppler, 2D CCD/H2RG/H4RG vetoes, sparse G6 coincidence gating, and upgraded Channel 5
  COMB_V4_1 matched filtering), unified with planetary-rest-frame 1.4 GHz narrowband radio
  searches (Parkes/GBT) and TESS specular light-sail photometry into a 181-system all-sky
  multi-messenger synthesis.
authors:
  - family-names: "Andersen"
    given-names: "Martin"
version: 0.12.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
